    Z23: Zhou+2023 (ApJ 946, 73) Table 4: 34 points, 5.24-24.00 kpc; median stat 0.55 km/s, sys 1.0%-3.0%
    J23: Jiao+2023 (A&A 678, A208) Table 3: 18 points, 9.50-26.50 kpc; median stat 4.52 km/s, sys in sigma

